#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:8
msgid "路由"
msgstr "Routing"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:10
msgid "一条路由把目标节点映射到 PHY 及其完整帧 MTU。路由属于协议配置，Network 层持有固定路由表与可选的私有索引。容量耗尽时返回错误。"
msgstr ""
"A route maps a destination node to a PHY and its full-frame MTU. Routes are protocol configuration. The "
"network layer owns a fixed-capacity route table and an optional private index. Exhausted capacity "
"returns an error."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:12
msgid "查找与容量"
msgstr "Lookup and Capacity"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:14
msgid ""
"实例初始化拒绝目标为零、本机 ID 或重复目标的静态配置。广播目标允许显式配置。整表加载在替换前检查无效目标、空 PHY 和重复目标；拒绝的配置不会清除已有路由。未知目标返回路由不存在。Boot "
"使用有界线性查找，其他当前 profile 使用固定 16 桶索引。发送规划考虑完整帧 MTU，以及 DATA_TYPE、SESSION、SECURITY、标签和 CRC 的开销。"
msgstr ""
"Instance initialization rejects static destinations that are zero, the local ID, or duplicates. An "
"explicit broadcast destination is allowed. Whole-table loading checks invalid destinations, null PHYs "
"and duplicates before replacing existing entries; rejected configuration leaves the previous routes "
"intact. Unknown destinations return route-not-found. Boot uses bounded linear lookup; other current "
"profiles use a fixed 16-bucket index. Send planning includes full-frame MTU and SESSION, DATA_TYPE, "
"SECURITY, tag and CRC overhead."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:16
msgid "`metric` 是保留的兼容字段，不参与出口选择，也不提供多路径择优。私有路由表仍支持更新已有目的和复用删除后的槽；查询返回的借用指针可能在删除、加载或清空后失效。"
msgstr ""
"`metric` is a reserved compatibility field; it does not select an egress or provide multipath ranking. "
"The private table still supports updating existing destinations and reusing removed slots. Borrowed "
"lookup pointers may become invalid after removal, loading or clearing."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:18
msgid "链路装配与生命周期"
msgstr "Link Assembly and Lifetime"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:20
msgid ""
"实例借用的配置必须保持有效且不可变，直到销毁。工作区规划与链路初始化共用 PHY 首次出现的判定，每个唯一 PHY 只建立一个 parser 和接收缓存。多个目的可以共用 PHY；其 "
"`read_freq_hz` 初始化提示合并为最短轮询周期，与配置顺序无关。毫秒调度下非零频率的最短周期为 1 ms。"
msgstr ""
"Borrowed instance configuration must remain valid and immutable until destruction. Workspace planning "
"and link initialization share the same first-PHY occurrence rule, creating one parser and RX cache per "
"unique PHY. Multiple destinations may share a PHY; their `read_freq_hz` initialization hints merge into "
"the shortest polling interval, independently of configuration order. With millisecond scheduling, a "
"nonzero frequency has a minimum interval of 1 ms."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:22
msgid ""
"路由表只负责目的出口，链路对象负责轮询和接收存储。兼容配置仍使用同一个公开结构，未增加第二份配置副本。私有路由增删不注册新 PHY、不重建接收缓存，也不改变已确定的轮询周期；公开 API "
"不承诺运行时链路热更新。当前仍需通过路由配置注册 PHY，没有独立的仅接收链路配置入口。"
msgstr ""
"Routes select destination egress; link objects own polling and receive storage. The compatible public "
"configuration still uses one structure without a second configuration copy. Private route mutations do "
"not register a new PHY, rebuild RX caches or change established polling intervals. The public API does "
"not promise runtime link replacement. PHY registration still comes from route configuration; there is no"
" separate receive-only link configuration entry."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:24
msgid ""
"包身份与出口选择分开。更换私有路由不会重置 transport scope、DATA 编号或安全关联；但这不代表可以把已接纳包迁移到更小的 MTU。需要动态链路管理的产品应先定义容量、停用、在途包和回滚契约。"
msgstr ""
"Packet identity is separate from egress selection. Private route updates do not reset transport scopes, "
"DATA numbers or security associations, but this does not make migration of accepted packets to a smaller"
" MTU safe. Products requiring dynamic links must first define capacity, shutdown, in-flight packet and "
"rollback contracts."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:26
msgid "转发"
msgstr "Forwarding"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:28
msgid ""
"Embedded 和 Full 支持转发。转发节点验证完整帧，要求目标路由，检查出口完整帧 MTU，并拒绝不足以再经过一跳的 TTL。然后取得有界 scratch，递减 TTL，重写帧头 CRC 与最终 "
"CRC，再同步发送。"
msgstr ""
"Embedded and Full support forwarding. A forwarder validates the complete frame, requires a destination "
"route, checks the outgoing full-frame MTU and rejects TTL values that cannot survive another hop. It "
"obtains bounded scratch, decrements TTL, rewrites the header CRC and final CRC, then synchronously "
"transmits the frame."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:30
msgid "端到端认证标签与被认证载荷保持不变。AAD 规范化排除了 TTL 和帧头 CRC；转发不会安装本地信任，也不声称已验证目标标签。目标为本机的认证帧在 transport 投递前完成验签。"
msgstr ""
"The end-to-end authentication tag and authenticated payload remain unchanged. TTL and header CRC are "
"canonicalized out of AAD; forwarding does not install local trust or claim that the destination tag was "
"verified. A locally addressed authenticated frame is verified before transport delivery."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:32
msgid ""
"正常 datalink → network 端点必须携带已验证的借用 view，不再接受 raw 回退。独立的私有 raw 接收函数保留完整解码和实例帧长检查。转发从 view 取得唯一的帧地址和长度，不修改"
" parser 缓存；同步 serialized 提交复用同一份 scratch，不再申请第二份整帧。"
msgstr ""
"The normal datalink-to-network endpoint requires a validated borrowed view and has no raw fallback. A "
"separate private raw receive function retains complete decoding and the instance frame-size check. "
"Forwarding obtains the sole frame address and length from the view without modifying parser storage. "
"Synchronous serialized submission uses the same scratch allocation instead of reserving another complete"
" frame."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:34
msgid ""
"下层提交失败保留原始错误，例如 `XGL_ERR_BUSY`，并释放 scratch。没有中继排队或自动重试承诺；可靠性由端点 transport "
"负责。返回值是本次操作的权威结果，错误回调仅报告指定事件，并不覆盖所有错误返回。"
msgstr ""
"Failed lower-layer submission preserves its original error, such as `XGL_ERR_BUSY`, and releases "
"scratch. The relay does not promise queuing or automatic retry; endpoint transport owns reliability. The"
" return value is authoritative for the operation. Error callbacks report selected events and do not "
"cover every error return."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:36
msgid ""
"源端应按路径瓶颈配置发送上限；路径 MTU 由应用配置。可靠 A → B → C 通信还需要 C 的“目的 A、出口经 B”路由供 ACK 返回；只有到邻居 B 的路由不够。RX view 不携带入口 "
"PHY，目的路由查找不等于来源授权。"
msgstr ""
"Senders must respect the path MTU bottleneck. Set the application block size before sending. Reliable "
"A-to-B-to-C delivery also needs a route at C with destination A and egress through B for the ACK; a "
"route only to neighbor B is insufficient. RX views carry no ingress PHY, and destination lookup is not "
"source authorization."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:38
msgid ""
"本地可靠 DATA 在交付或保留前检查反向出口及反馈帧预算。缺路由时返回 `XGL_ERR_ROUTE_NOT_FOUND`，出口容量不足时返回 "
"`XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL`。要求认证的反馈还会检查反向会话是否有可用安全序号，耗尽时返回 `XGL_ERR_SEQUENCE_ERROR`。预检不消耗序号。预算计入非零 epoch "
"和出站认证标签。例如单区间 ACK、非零 epoch 和 16 字节标签共需 86 字节。应用接纳后遇到 PHY 背压时保留接收历史，以便重传触发再次反馈。产品分别验证正向 DATA 和反向反馈的每一跳。"
msgstr ""
"Before delivering or retaining reliable local DATA, the receiver checks its reverse egress and feedback "
"frame budget. A missing route returns `XGL_ERR_ROUTE_NOT_FOUND`. Insufficient egress capacity returns "
"`XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL`. For authenticated feedback, the preflight checks the reverse session for an "
"available security sequence and returns `XGL_ERR_SEQUENCE_ERROR` if it is exhausted. The check does not "
"consume a sequence. The budget includes a nonzero epoch and the outgoing authentication tag. A single-"
"range ACK with a nonzero epoch and a 16-byte tag needs 86 bytes. PHY backpressure after admission "
"preserves receive history so retransmission can trigger feedback again. Validate every hop separately "
"for forward DATA and reverse feedback."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:40
msgid "广播与可靠性"
msgstr "Broadcast and Reliability"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:42
msgid ""
"广播使用节点 `0xFFFF`。认证策略允许时支持明文非可靠广播。可靠广播提交在创建 transport 所有权前返回 `XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM`；接收到请求确认的广播时，在改变 peer"
" 历史或发送反馈前返回 `XGL_ERR_INVALID_FRAME`，不能消耗同一来源的单播 DATA "
"编号。认证实现只支持单播关联，不提供组可靠投递或组认证协议。双方容量与功能兼容性由应用配置，路由发现不会协商 transport 窗口或可信 epoch。"
msgstr ""
"Broadcast uses node `0xFFFF`. Plain unreliable broadcast is available when the authentication policy "
"allows it. Reliable broadcast submission returns `XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM` before creating transport "
"ownership; a received broadcast that requests acknowledgement returns `XGL_ERR_INVALID_FRAME` before "
"changing peer history or sending feedback. It cannot consume the same source's unicast DATA number. The "
"authentication implementation supports unicast associations only; no group reliable-delivery or group-"
"authentication protocol is provided. Capacity and feature compatibility between peers are configured by "
"the application; route discovery does not negotiate transport windows or trusted epochs."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/routing.md:44
msgid ""
"收到广播只执行本地交付，不跨 PHY 泛洪；发送广播需要显式广播出口。TTL 只限制继续转发：0/1 不可转发，本地目的帧仍可交付。查出口先于 TTL 检查，因此同时无路由且 TTL 过期时返回 "
"`XGL_ERR_ROUTE_NOT_FOUND`。"
msgstr ""
"Received broadcast is delivered locally without flooding other PHYs; transmission requires an explicit "
"broadcast egress. TTL limits continued forwarding: 0/1 cannot be forwarded, while locally addressed "
"frames may still be delivered. Egress lookup precedes TTL checking, so a frame with both no route and "
"expired TTL returns `XGL_ERR_ROUTE_NOT_FOUND`."

